  "published": "2026-11-12T18:58:24.01Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "6.4.0\n      - New Users & Access page (Views/DotNetSetup/Users.cshtml and Scripts/dotnetreport-users.js): users, roles and tenants from your code, a SQL query or Dotnet Report Managed.\n      - Permissions without Admin Mode: Manage Access, Manage Headers & Footers, View Report SQL and Manage Users, by role or by user, inside the person's own tenant. View Only role.\n      - Setup App Settings saves the workspace, its connection and email settings (SMTP or SendGrid, with Send Test Email) to appsettings.dotnetreport.json.\n      - Gauge (Gauge, Half Circle, Progress Ring, Progress Bar) and Funnel charts.\n      - Dashboard Live Preview: drag and resize tiles while picking reports.\n      - Filters button on reports and dashboards, showing whether you see your saved filters or the report's. Editing a report always edits the report's filters and never overwrites personal ones.\n      - KPI Vertical Alignment, less empty margin around charts in small tiles, cleaner world map colors with an optional color scale.\n      - Font Awesome 7 (fa fa-* class names keep working), cleaner menus and schedule dialog.\n      - Fixes: chart Y-axis format, Show Small Values On Label, resizing map tiles, empty space in tiles without a chart, custom date Between filters, switching to or from KPI, map zoom.\n      - Upgrading: Users & Roles moved out of Setup to the Users action on DotNetSetupController.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
